    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1.7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðonne uthleape ⁊ þæt ordal forbuge, gylde se borh ðam teonde his ceapgyld ⁊ ðam hlaforde his were ðe his wites wyrðe sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he escapes and avoids his ordeal, his surety shall pay the value of his goods to the accuser and the wergeld of the accused to the lord who is entitled to the fines incurred by him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne uhtleape ⁊ þæt ordal forbuge, gylde se borh þam teonde his ceapgyld ⁊ þam hlaforde his were, þe his wites wyrðe sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
